---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="The software factory | Jonatan Snyders" description="An always-on software factory: agents that pick up goals, do the work caged and unattended. State lives in the substrate, not the agent.">
  <div class="factory-page">

    <!-- 1. Hero -->
    <header class="factory-hero">
      <p class="factory-kicker">what excites me</p>
      <h1>The software factory I'm building.</h1>
      <p class="factory-lede">
        An always-on software factory: agents that pick up goals, do the work caged and unattended, and that I'm steadily teaching to run themselves. The idea underneath it: state lives in the substrate, not the agent — so the agents are disposable and the whole system is crash-resumable. Here are the pieces, and where I am on the way there.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- 2. System map diagram -->
    <section class="factory-map" aria-label="System map">
      <div class="map-wrap">
        <div class="map-hub-row">
          <!-- Center node — hub (first in DOM for mobile; reordered at desktop) -->
          <div class="map-center">
            <div class="map-center-label">MY HARNESS</div>
            <div class="map-center-sub">built on <a href="https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-link">pi</a></div>
            <div class="map-center-tags">substrate · tiered memory<br>orchestration · methodology</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Running-now nodes (solid) — left column at desktop -->
          <div class="map-spokes map-spokes--running">
            <div class="map-node map-node--running">
              <a href="https://github.com/jsnyde0/rip-cage" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-node-name map-link">rip-cage</a>
              <span class="map-node-role">the cage</span>
            </div>
            <div class="map-node map-node--running">
              <span class="map-node-name">always-on host</span>
              <span class="map-node-role">Mac mini / VPS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="map-node map-node--running">
              <span class="map-node-name">the cockpit</span>
              <span class="map-node-role">herdr / cmux</span>
            </div>
            <div class="map-node map-node--running">
              <span class="map-node-name">disposable orchestrators</span>
              <span class="map-node-role">read → act → die</span>
            </div>
            <div class="map-node map-node--running">
              <span class="map-node-name">the drover</span>
              <span class="map-node-role">suggest-mode</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Frontier zone (dashed / lighter) — right column at desktop -->
          <div class="map-frontier-zone">
            <div class="map-frontier-label">frontier</div>
            <div class="map-spokes map-spokes--frontier">
              <div class="map-node map-node--frontier">
                <span class="map-node-name">full self-driving</span>
                <span class="map-node-role">drover off-leash</span>
              </div>
              <div class="map-node map-node--frontier">
                <span class="map-node-name">agent_mail</span>
                <span class="map-node-role">collision avoidance</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Legend -->
        <div class="map-legend">
          <span class="legend-item legend-item--running">running now</span>
          <span class="legend-item legend-item--frontier">exploring / frontier</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. The pieces -->
    <section class="factory-pieces">
      <h2>The pieces</h2>

      <div class="pieces-group">
        <h3 class="pieces-group-label">Running now</h3>
        <ul class="pieces-list">
          <li>
            <strong>My harness, built on <a href="https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="factory-link">pi</a></strong> — I design the whole system and build the parts where I have an edge. It runs on pi because pi is hackable all the way down — closed harnesses like Claude Code only let you bolt on hooks and skills, but parts of my system only exist because I can change the agent itself. The LLM behind it is swappable; the harness is the moat.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>The substrate — state lives here</strong> — goals are nodes in a bead graph, not a chat log; memory is tiered by lifecycle so nothing load-bearing is trapped in a context window that's about to be compacted. (session search &amp; memory via cass/cm, by Jeffrey Emanuel)
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong><a href="https://github.com/jsnyde0/rip-cage" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="factory-link">rip-cage</a> — the cage</strong> — wraps the work in a container and intercepts every shell command to limit the blast radius; composes with iron-proxy so the agents never hold real credentials.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Always-on host</strong> — it runs on a box that's always on — a Mac mini now, a VPS next — not my laptop. I close the lid and the agents keep going. With the crash-resumable substrate, that's what makes "unattended" actually true.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>The cockpit</strong> — herdr gives me a live roster of every session — working, blocked, done — that I can attach to and steer; cmux is the view on the Mac. (herdr by Ogulcan Celik · cmux by Manaflow)
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Disposable orchestrators</strong> — each one reads the graph, makes a single move, writes its decision back, and dies; re-spawn it and it picks up from the substrate. No agent is precious; the substrate is. (my /send-it + composable primitives)
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>The drover — running, in suggest-mode</strong> — a planner over the whole bead graph. It already runs: it gets an event whenever a piece of work closes and proposes what to pick up next. For now I stay in the loop, approving its moves while I sharpen its judgment — then I give it more rope.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="pieces-group pieces-group--frontier">
        <h3 class="pieces-group-label pieces-group-label--frontier">Exploring / the frontier</h3>
        <ul class="pieces-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Full self-driving</strong> — the drover acting on its own, no human in the loop (the auto-trigger that decides what to wake up for). That's exactly the edge I'm working at right now.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>agent_mail</strong> — collision-avoidance rails so parallel agents don't step on each other. I'm planning to adopt it — honestly, not battle-tested yet. (by Jeffrey Emanuel)
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Closing -->
    <footer class="factory-closing">
      <p>That gap — between "proposes what to do next" and "just does it" — is the whole game right now. I'd rather show you a system I'm honestly still building than a finished story that doesn't run.</p>
    </footer>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .factory-page {
    width: min(100%, 64rem);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Hero ── */
  .factory-hero {
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 0 0 3.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .factory-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .factory-hero h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 7vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--content-bright);
  }

  .factory-lede {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 50rem;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    color: var(--muted-content);
  }

  /* ── System Map ── */
  .factory-map {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .map-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .map-hub-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .map-center {
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--primary-tint);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 127, 80, 0.35);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .map-center-label {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .map-center-sub {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted-content);
    margin-bottom: 0.625rem;
  }

  .map-center-tags {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted-content);
    opacity: 0.8;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .map-link {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(255, 127, 80, 0.4);
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color var(--transition-base), text-decoration-color var(--transition-base);
  }

  .map-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-focus);
    text-decoration-color: var(--primary-focus);
  }

  /* Running-now spokes */
  .map-spokes--running {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(9rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .map-node {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.875rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .map-node--running {
    background: var(--surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .map-node-name {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--content-bright);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  a.map-node-name {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(255, 127, 80, 0.4);
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color var(--transition-base);
  }

  a.map-node-name:hover {
    color: var(--primary-focus);
  }

  .map-node-role {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--muted-content);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* Legend */
  .map-legend {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .legend-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted-content);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .legend-item::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1rem;
    height: 0.625rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .legend-item--running::before {
    background: var(--surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .legend-item--frontier::before {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px dashed rgba(171, 196, 220, 0.3);
  }

  /* Frontier zone */
  .map-frontier-zone {
    padding: 1rem 1rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1.5px dashed rgba(171, 196, 220, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    position: relative;
  }

  .map-frontier-label {
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.625rem;
    left: 1rem;
    padding: 0 0.5rem;
    background: var(--base-100);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-content);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .map-spokes--frontier {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(10rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .map-node--frontier {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px dashed rgba(171, 196, 220, 0.22);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .map-node--frontier .map-node-name {
    color: var(--base-content);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Tablet: 2-col running nodes */
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .map-spokes--running {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Desktop: 3-column hub layout via flexbox row */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .map-wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .map-hub-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .map-spokes--running {
      flex: 1;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.625rem;
      order: 1;
    }

    .map-center {
      flex: 0 0 15rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      order: 2;
    }

    .map-frontier-zone {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      order: 3;
    }

    .map-spokes--frontier {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.625rem;
    }

    .map-legend {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  /* ── The pieces list ── */
  .factory-pieces {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .factory-pieces h2 {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.625rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--content-bright);
  }

  .pieces-group {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .pieces-group-label {
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-content);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .pieces-group--frontier .pieces-group-label {
    border-bottom-style: dashed;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .pieces-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.875rem;
  }

  .pieces-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    color: var(--base-content);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .pieces-group--frontier .pieces-list li {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .pieces-list strong {
    color: var(--content-bright);
  }

  .factory-link {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(255, 127, 80, 0.4);
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color var(--transition-base), text-decoration-color var(--transition-base);
  }

  .factory-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-focus);
    text-decoration-color: var(--primary-focus);
  }

  /* ── Closing ── */
  .factory-closing {
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .factory-closing p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    color: var(--muted-content);
    font-style: italic;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
</style>
